OL,3,GNEWSAShock after hundreds of letters
OL,4,Afound dumped on country road and layby
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Mail has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation after "hundreds" of
OL,8,Fundelivered letters were "discarded" on
OL,9,Fa country road, with more being found
OL,10,Fon a layby.
OL,12,FAn estimated 600 unopened letters in
OL,13,Ftotal have now been handed into a
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland assembly member's
OL,15,Foffice.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
