OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAShock after hundreds of letters
OL,4,Afound dumped on country road and layby
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, Social Democratic and
OL,7,FLabour Party (SDLP) MLA Mark H Durkan
OL,8,Fwas contacted by a member of the public
OL,9,Fwho was on the Mobuoy Road and found a
OL,10,Fbag, which he opened and "to his
OL,11,Fhorror" they contained "hundreds of
OL,12,Fitems of unopened mail" of a personal
OL,13,Fnature.
OL,15,FThen on Thursday afternoon, a different
OL,16,Fperson left more letters into Durkan's
OL,17,Foffice. He said those letters were
OL,18,Ffound in a "totally different
OL,19,Flocation".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
